# Both images build from the repository root, so everything the build does not
# need is a file the daemon copies for nothing. Without this the context is
# hundreds of megabytes of node_modules and build output, and every `docker build`
# pays for it before running a single instruction.

.git
.github
.vs
.angular

**/bin
**/obj
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/TestResults
**/test-results
**/playwright-report

# Logs written by a local run of the host or the migrator.
Logs
**/Logs

# Never into an image: real secrets, and the local environment file.
**/appsettings.secrets.json
.env

# Uploaded media from a local run. The container mounts a volume for this.
**/App_Data

# Documentation, archives and local scratch.
docs
screens
angular/screens
*.zip
*.docx
*.pdf
